# EtSection Component

## Purpose & Scope

`EtSection` is a flexible section container component for the eToro design system. It provides consistent layout for section-based UI patterns with:

- **Static title** (`EtSection.Title`) - Simple heading text
- **Pressable select title** (`EtSection.SelectTitle`) - Title with chevron for pickers/selectors
- **Chips group** (`EtSection.Chips`) - Wraps EtChipsGroupV2 with auto fadeColor
- **Pagination dots** (`EtSection.Pagination`) - Wraps EtPagination with section defaults (size="small", color="neutral")
- **Flexible content area** (`EtSection.Content`) - Container for custom content (lists, text, etc.)

**Does NOT handle:**

- State management for selectors (parent component controls this)
- Content rendering (you provide the content)
- Background styling (transparent by default)
- Section-level padding (consumer controls outer padding)

## Entry Points & Contracts

### `EtSection` (main component)

```tsx
<EtSection
  title?: string              // Shorthand for static title
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  {children}
</EtSection>
```

### `EtSection.Title`

```tsx
<EtSection.Title
  style?: StyleProp<TextStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  {string | ReactNode}
</EtSection.Title>
```

### `EtSection.SelectTitle`

```tsx
<EtSection.SelectTitle
  text: string                 // Required - title text
  onPress: () => void          // Required - opens picker/selector
  haptics?: boolean            // default: true
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
  accessibilityLabel?: string
  accessibilityHint?: string
/>
```

Note: Uses EtSelect with variant="text" internally.

### `EtSection.Chips`

```tsx
<EtSection.Chips
  items: ChipsGroupItem[]     // Required - chip items
  selectionMode?: 'none' | 'single' | 'multi'
  value?: string | null | string[]
  onChange?: (value) => void
  layout?: 'scroll' | 'wrap'  // default: 'scroll'
  gap?: number                // default: X2 (8px)
  fadeColor?: string          // default: theme bgNeutralPrimary
  haptics?: boolean           // default: true
  ...EtChipsGroupV2Props
/>
```

### `EtSection.Pagination`

```tsx
<EtSection.Pagination
  totalPages: number                          // Required - total number of pages
  currentPage: number | SharedValue<number>   // Required - current page (0-indexed)
  size?: 'small' | 'large'                   // default: 'small' (overrides EtPagination default of 'large')
  color?: 'neutral' | 'primary'              // default: 'neutral'
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
  accessibilityLabel?: string
/>
```

Note: Wraps EtPagination with section-appropriate defaults. Use with `usePagination` hook for scroll-driven carousels.

### `EtSection.Content`

```tsx
<EtSection.Content
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
>
  {ReactNode}
</EtSection.Content>
```

## Layout Specs

| Property               | Value        | Token         |
| ---------------------- | ------------ | ------------- |
| Gap (between elements) | 12px         | X3            |
| Title style            | heading-large | 22px semibold |

## Usage Patterns

### Static title with chips

```tsx
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>My Watchlist</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Chips items={chips} selectionMode="single" value={selected} onChange={setSelected} />
</EtSection>
```

### Select title with chips (pressable)

```tsx
const [selectedPeriod, setSelectedPeriod] = useState('1M');

<EtSection>
  <EtSection.SelectTitle text={selectedPeriod} onPress={() => openPeriodPicker()} accessibilityHint="Opens period selector" />
  <EtSection.Chips items={filterChips} selectionMode="single" value={selected} onChange={setSelected} />
</EtSection>;
```

### Static title with custom content

```tsx
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>About eToro</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Content>
    <EtText>Custom content here...</EtText>
  </EtSection.Content>
</EtSection>
```

### Shorthand with title prop

```tsx
<EtSection title="Quick Section">
  <EtSection.Chips items={chips} ... />
</EtSection>
```

### Title with carousel and pagination

```tsx
import { EtSection, usePagination } from 'etoro-ui';
import Animated from 'react-native-reanimated';

const CARD_WIDTH = 300;
const CARD_GAP = 8;
const SNAP_INTERVAL = CARD_WIDTH + CARD_GAP;

const { currentPageAnimated, scrollHandler } = usePagination({
  totalPages: 5,
  itemWidth: SNAP_INTERVAL,
});

<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Featured</EtSection.Title>
  <Animated.FlatList
    horizontal
    data={items}
    onScroll={scrollHandler}
    scrollEventThrottle={16}
    snapToInterval={SNAP_INTERVAL}
    decelerationRate="fast"
    renderItem={renderItem}
  />
  <EtSection.Pagination totalPages={5} currentPage={currentPageAnimated} />
</EtSection>;
```

Note: The FlatList and Pagination are direct children of EtSection, so the section's `gap: X3` (12px) applies between them automatically.

### Full-width breakout pattern

When the page has horizontal padding (e.g. `padding: 16`), use `marginHorizontal: -PAGE_PADDING` on Chips or a carousel FlatList to make them scroll edge-to-edge. Add `contentContainerStyle={{ paddingHorizontal: PAGE_PADDING }}` to align the first item with the title instead of the screen edge.

**Edge-to-edge** (first item at screen edge):

```tsx
const PAGE_PADDING = 16;

<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Watchlist</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Chips items={chips} selectionMode="single" value={selected} onChange={setSelected} style={{ marginHorizontal: -PAGE_PADDING }} />
</EtSection>;
```

**Padded** (first item aligned with title):

```tsx
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Watchlist</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Chips
    items={chips}
    selectionMode="single"
    value={selected}
    onChange={setSelected}
    style={{ marginHorizontal: -PAGE_PADDING }}
    contentContainerStyle={{ paddingHorizontal: PAGE_PADDING }}
  />
</EtSection>
```

The same pattern applies to carousel FlatLists and EtSection.Pagination:

```tsx
<Animated.FlatList
  horizontal
  style={{ marginHorizontal: -PAGE_PADDING }}
  contentContainerStyle={{ paddingHorizontal: PAGE_PADDING }}
  snapToInterval={SNAP_INTERVAL}
  ...
/>
<EtSection.Pagination
  style={{ marginHorizontal: -PAGE_PADDING }}
  ...
/>
```

### Section without content (title only)

```tsx
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Section Header</EtSection.Title>
</EtSection>
```

## Anti-patterns

### Do NOT nest multiple titles

```tsx
// BAD - only one title per section
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Title 1</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.SelectTitle text="Title 2" onPress={fn} />
</EtSection>

// GOOD - choose one title type
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.SelectTitle text="Select Period" onPress={fn} />
  <EtSection.Content>...</EtSection.Content>
</EtSection>
```

### Do NOT use title prop with Title subcomponent

```tsx
// BAD - redundant
<EtSection title="My Title">
  <EtSection.Title>Another Title</EtSection.Title>
</EtSection>

// GOOD - use one approach
<EtSection title="My Title">
  <EtSection.Chips items={chips} ... />
</EtSection>
```

### Do NOT use EtChipsGroupV2 directly in Content

```tsx
// BAD - use EtSection.Chips instead
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Filters</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Content>
    <EtChipsGroupV2 items={chips} ... />
  </EtSection.Content>
</EtSection>

// GOOD - use dedicated Chips subcomponent
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Filters</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Chips items={chips} ... />
</EtSection>
```

### Do NOT use EtPagination directly in Content

```tsx
// BAD - use EtSection.Pagination instead
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Featured</EtSection.Title>
  <EtSection.Content>
    <Carousel />
    <EtPagination totalPages={5} currentPage={0} />
  </EtSection.Content>
</EtSection>

// GOOD - use dedicated Pagination subcomponent
<EtSection>
  <EtSection.Title>Featured</EtSection.Title>
  <Carousel />
  <EtSection.Pagination totalPages={5} currentPage={currentPageAnimated} />
</EtSection>
```

### Do NOT pass non-string to SelectTitle

```tsx
// BAD - SelectTitle uses text prop, not children
<EtSection.SelectTitle onPress={fn}>
  <View><Text>Title</Text></View>
</EtSection.SelectTitle>

// GOOD - use text prop
<EtSection.SelectTitle text="Selected Option" onPress={fn} />
```

## Dependencies & Edges

### Internal Dependencies

- `useEtoroTheme` - provides theme colors
- `EtText` - underlying text component for Title
- `EtSelect` - underlying component for SelectTitle (compact variant)
- `EtPagination` - underlying component for Pagination
- `SectionContext` - React context for passing state to subcomponents

### External Dependencies

- `react-native` - `View`, `StyleSheet`

### Design System Integration

- Colors come from theme (`useEtoroTheme().colors`)
- Spacing uses design tokens (`X2`, `X3`, `X5` from `core/styles/spacing`)
- Title uses `heading-large` text variant (22px semibold)

